Stockfish third-party notice

ChessLens uses the Stockfish 17.1 Lite single-thread WebAssembly build
from stockfish@17.1.0. Stockfish is distributed under GNU GPL version 3.
The WebAssembly port credits Nathan Rugg, Chess.com, and the Stockfish
developers and contributors. See public/stockfish/Copying.txt after the
asset copy step for the full GPL text.

Corresponding source for the bundled WebAssembly port:
https://github.com/nmrugg/stockfish.js/tree/602fd7e1a571a2be71f242942db90483731f2a1f
Upstream Stockfish source:
https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish/tree/sf_17.1

When distributing the engine binaries, provide access to the matching
corresponding source under GPL-3.0. This notice covers the third-party
engine. No separate license for the original ChessLens code is declared.
